  to keep in mind for your upgrade is that it's a swap out of the system
  box (different CPU module in the DS5000/240 and it uses a daughter card).
  This means that you want the package to include whatever it takes to go
  from a Thickwire on the back of the workstation to your network. Remember
  that the DS5000/200 was a Thinwire only machine.

