  of R4000 upgrades for the daughter card machines. I don't recall that any
  statements were made around Alpha.

  If you're talking about upgrade packages that include box swaps, it would
  seem pretty likely. We usually do offer that kind of thing. Keep in mind
  that TURBOchannel is on the Alpha workstations as well. So you can keep and
  play with a lot of the hardware you're using now.

