        o  volume effective across the full volume range (now 0-100)
        o  volume scaling corrects uneven volume increases due to the
           non-linear nature of human hearing
        o  individual track selection via track buttons
        o  highlighting of a track button for track "now playing"
        o  button icons for quit, shuffle, and repeat modes
        o  zillions of bug fixes
        o  man pages for xcd and locate_cd
        o  app-defaults file (use as a template for your ~/.Xdefaults
           entries)
        o  setable program defaults through UIL file
        o  improved UIL defaults
        o  more compact display via slightly smaller function buttons
        o  scan mode with audio cues
        o  re-designed status display
        o  option menu for elapsed/remaining/total time info
        o  index number added to track number
        o  annoying "flashing" of status reduced to numbers being updated
           and eliminated when in "totals" mode
        o  improved support for monochrome
        o  more complete default control in /usr/lib/X11/app-defaults/Xcd
           (use Xcd as a template for your ~/.Xdefaults)
        o  quit no longer stops play before exit()


