> We are having a problem with DECNet and X-windows.  We have a VAXCluster
> connected to a thickwire segment with DELNI's and several MIPS Ultrix systems
> and NCD X-terminals attached via a DEMPR (DEC's multiple thinwire segment
> repeater) to the same thickwire segment.  Though the X-terminals are largely
> used with the Unix systems via TCP/IP, we often have a VMS DECTerm window
