Subject: Information on a beast called a VID-10 workstation.
Message-ID: <1992Feb10.163812.10266@ultb.isc.rit.edu>
Followup-To: poster
Keywords: Help!
Sender: news@ultb.isc.rit.edu (USENET News System)
