> definitely be software-selected). Is there a particularly good reason
> for not allowing the user to move the controller to another address
> (with jumpers on the board, or a command in the boot monitor) ?

  It's not hardwired. You can change it via the SET SCSIA or SET SCSIB
commands (my VS3100-30 with firmware V1.6 even mentions this in the built-
in HELP command).

